 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 5.385,
   "text": "Word spread. Thousands came from every town, pushing just to touch him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 5.685,
   "end": 9.256,
   "text": "So he kept a boat ready, in case the crowd crushed him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 9.756,
   "end": 13.057,
   "text": "Even the unclean spirits fell down and screamed:",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 13.257,
   "end": 15.142,
   "text": "You are the Son of God!",
   "tempter": true
  },
  {
   "start": 15.942,
   "end": 19.525,
   "text": "Then he climbed a mountain, and called the ones he wanted.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 20.125,
   "end": 25.997,
   "text": "Simon, the Rock. James and John, the Sons of Thunder. Andrew. Philip. Bartholomew.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 26.247,
   "end": 29.325,
   "text": "Matthew. Thomas. James. Thaddaeus. Simon.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 29.675,
   "end": 33.472,
   "text": "And Judas Iscariot. The one who would betray him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 34.172,
   "end": 39.019,
   "text": "Twelve ordinary men. Sent out to preach, and to drive out demons.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 39.619,
   "end": 45.257,
   "text": "When his own family heard, they came to take him home. They said: He has lost his mind.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 45.757,
   "end": 48.775,
   "text": "He drives out demons by the prince of demons!",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 49.175,
   "end": 54.912,
   "text": "How can Satan drive out Satan? A house divided against itself cannot stand.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 55.812,
   "end": 60.311,
   "text": "Then his mother and brothers came, and stood outside, and sent for him.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 60.711,
   "end": 63.047,
   "text": "Who are my mother and my brothers?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 63.847,
   "end": 68.069,
   "text": "Whoever does the will of God is my brother, and sister, and mother.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 68.969,
   "end": 72.137,
   "text": "Follow for part six.",
   "tempter": false
  }
 ]
}